# Auto-detect text files and normalise to LF in the repository.
# `eol=lf` is explicit rather than left to `text=auto`: the project is developed on Windows and
# deployed to Alpine containers, and a CRLF that survives into a shell script or a Caddyfile
# fails in ways that look like a config error rather than a line-ending one.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# The lockfile is reviewed by what changed in package.json, never line by line.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff
